ities (MCP servers, plugins, permissions)\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Local Agent Tasks** — Where Agents/Tasks are Defined\n\nAgent tasks are **not explicitly \"defined\" or \"registered\"** in the traditional sense. Instead, Memo-Ray **passively ingests** agent activity logs and models them as entities. Here's where agent behavior is captured:\n\n**File Paths for Agent Task Capture:**\n\n1. **Claude Code Session Logs** (parseAuditFile):\n   - `C:\\Users\\nsdha\\AppData\\Roaming\\Claude\\projects\\` (main location)\n   - `C:\\Users\\nsdha\\AppData\\Roaming\\Claude\\local-agent-mode-sessions\\`\n   - `C:\\Users\\nsdha\\AppData\\Roaming\\Claude\\claude-code-sessions\\`\n   - `~/.claude/projects/` (Mac/Linux)\n   - Files searched: `audit.jsonl` and `*.jsonl` (CLI logs)\n   - Parser: `/agent-os-dashboard/server/parsers/claudeParser.js` (lines 85-290)\n\n2. **Antigravity (Gemini) Transcripts** (parseTranscript):\n   - `~/.gemini/antigravity/brain/` (IDE location)\n   - `~/.gemini/antigravity-ide/brain/`\n   - Files: `transcript.jsonl`\n   - Parser: `/agent-os-dashboard/server/parsers/antigravityParser.js` (lines 73+)\n\n3. **Configuration Path**:\n   - Central manifest: `C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\memo-ray\\memoray.config.js` (defines all paths)\n   - Detector: `/agent-os-dashboard/server/lib/detector.js` (auto-detects or uses config overrides)\n\n**Agent Task Entity Types** (defined in data model):\n- `Session` — root of a task/conversation\n- `User Input` — human prompt\n- `Thought` — agent's internal reasoning\n- `Tool Call` — agent action (file edit, command, etc.)\n- `Tool Result` — result from tool execution\n- `Artifact` — generated file/document\n- `CoWork` — inter-agent sync events\n\n**Task Metadata Captured**:\n```json\n{\n  \"taskType\": \"Code\",  // or \"Chat\"\n  \"cwd\": \"working directory\",\n  \"gitBranch\": \"current git branch\",\n  \"entrypoint\": \"claude-desktop\",\n  \"version\": \"2.1.170\",\n  \"isActive\": true,\n  \"model\": \"claude-3-5-so