bble behavior and the\n  `window.__bennyBridgeContext` grounding. Lowest-risk, ships inside the cockpit window.\n- **4b — Standalone desktop pet**: a new always-on-top, transparent, frameless,\n  click-through Electron window created in `prime-silo/packaging/desktop/main.js`\n  (a second `BrowserWindow` beside the cockpit). The dog floats over the whole desktop,\n  talks to the Benny runtime + memo-ray over localhost, and toggles from the tray.\n  Reuse the existing overlay UI as the window's content so 4a and 4b share one renderer.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5 — Unify packaging, tray & release\n\n- Extend the runtime bundle (`prime-silo/packaging/runtime-bundle/`) + supervisor\n  (`packaging/desktop/runtime_supervisor.js`) to optionally launch opencode (serve mode)\n  and open-notebook alongside Benny's Python/Neo4j/JRE.\n- Add tray entries (`packaging/desktop/tray.js`): start/stop opencode + open-notebook,\n  open memo-ray audit, toggle the floating dog.\n- One installer via the existing `scripts/manage-release.js` + `release-desktop.yml`.\n  Mind the prior release lessons (tag/commit ordering; slim bundle + build guard).\n\n---\n\n## Critical files\n\n- `memo-ray/memoray.config.js` — agent path manifest (single source of truth).\n- `memo-ray/agent-os-dashboard/server/lib/detector.js` — probe lists + detect arrays.\n- `memo-ray/agent-os-dashboard/server/parsers/{claude,antigravity}Parser.js` — parser templates; new `opencodeParser.js`, `openNotebookParser.js`.\n- `memo-ray/agent-os-dashboard/server/index.js` — sync loop, `/api/system/capabilities` (L1095), `/api/beta/overview`.\n- `memo-ray/agent-os-dashboard/client/src/` — OverviewGrid / capabilities + Setup-status UI (add opencode column).\n- `prime-silo/app/L0/_all/mod/_core/onscreen_agent/` — floating overlay to reskin into the dog.\n- `prime-silo/packaging/desktop/{main.js,tray.js,runtime_supervisor.js}` — desktop pet window, tray, runtime launch.\n- `prime-silo/runtime/benny/graph/` — swarm/manifest executor for the