nfigured yet.\n- **Server:** all edited files pass `node --check`. **Client:** `vite build` succeeds.\n- **Cleaned up:** deleted the test notebook (0 notebooks remain) and both smoke-test files.\n\n## Two things worth flagging\n1. **Note/source content is null in list views.** open-notebook's list endpoints return metadata but not full `content`/`full_text` — that needs the per-item detail endpoint (`GET /api/notes/{id}`). Fine for lineage + audit now; it'll matter when we feed sources into Benny's RAG (Phase 2b), so I noted it for then.\n2. **`OPEN_NOTEBOOK_ENCRYPTION_KEY=benny` is hardcoded** in your compose. Fine locally, but should become a generated per-install secret if this ships in the bundle (Phase 5) — same pattern Benny already uses.\n\nBoth opencode and open-notebook now flow into memo-ray's audit layer on the next memo-ray restart. \n\nNext per the plan: **Phase 2b** (pipe open-notebook sources into Benny's RAG), **Phase 3** (opencode as a Benny execution backend), then the floating dog and packaging. Want me to keep going, or pause here so you can set up models in the open-notebook UI first?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1119,"cache_read_input_tokens":232093,"output_tokens":1169,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1119,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1169,"cache_read_input_tokens":232093,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1119,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1119},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcChhLTKBdDgYXkGL7atx","type":"assistant","uuid":"7d8aae2a-c505-4462-ae4d-29e4b2e60a77","timestamp":"2026-06-19T13:32:30.174Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\