ult\",\"model\":\"ollama/gpt-oss:20b\"}'\n```\nExpect `status:\"completed\"`, the `output`, and `git.changed_files`.\n\n## Handover stays current\n[prime-silo/OPEN-STUDIO.md](prime-silo/OPEN-STUDIO.md) status table and Phase 3 playbook are updated — including the two follow-ups a next agent can pick up: **(1)** wire opencode as a first-class swarm/manifest node type in `api/studio_executor.py`, and **(2)** add an explicit HITL approval node for mutating runs.\n\n## Where the whole effort stands\n- **Done & verified against real data:** Phase 1 (opencode audit), Phase 2 (open-notebook audit).\n- **Built, needs your live test:** Phase 2b (notebook→RAG bridge — export verified), Phase 3 (opencode backend).\n- **Code-complete, not run in a live build:** Phase 4a/4b (floating German Shepherd + desktop pet).\n- **Remaining:** Phase 5 (unify packaging/tray/release — bundle opencode + open-notebook beside Benny, per-install encryption key).\n\nOnly **Phase 5** is left unstarted, and it's fully specced in the handover. Want me to take it on, or pause here so you can test 2b and 3 first?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":88,"cache_read_input_tokens":422797,"output_tokens":1157,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":88,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1157,"cache_read_input_tokens":422797,"cache_creation_input_tokens":88,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":88},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcD2Tr28KpFgVzx3UZrSw","type":"assistant","uuid":"e63f1322-8ab7-4381-9e61-5c59fb8c0c7a","timestamp":"2026-06-19T17:38:36.450Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\runt