{"parentUuid":"c6325456-2a9e-4c07-a4c0-c8db47405c1f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DP7CQt8VPt52PpQgcDZziT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"open-notebook is configured — and it's **config-driven** so you can change it whenever.\n\n## What I scanned and wired\n| Role | Engine | Model |\n|---|---|---|\n| Chat | LM Studio `:1234` | `google/gemma-4-12b-qat` |\n| Advanced transformation | LM Studio | `google/gemma-4-12b-qat` |\n| Large context | LM Studio | `google/gemma-4-12b-qat` |\n| **Embedding** | LM Studio | `text-embedding-nomic-embed-text-v1.5` ✅ tested (768-dim) |\n| Tools (simple) | Lemonade NPU `:13305` | `Qwen3-8B-Hybrid` |\n| Text-to-speech | Lemonade NPU | `kokoro-v1` |\n| Speech-to-text | Lemonade NPU | `Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo` |\n\nApplied live: **2 credentials + 6 models + all 7 role defaults set.** Your \"heavy on LM Studio / simple+audio on Lemonade NPU\" split, exactly.\n\n## Config-driven, editable\n- [scripts/openstudio-models.config.json](prime-silo/scripts/openstudio-models.config.json) — providers, model list, role→model map. Edit this to swap models.\n- [scripts/configure-open-notebook-models.mjs](prime-silo/scripts/configure-open-notebook-models.mjs) — idempotent. Re-run `node scripts/configure-open-notebook-models.mjs` any time and it reconciles open-notebook to the config.\n\n## The one gotcha I hit (and solved)\nopen-notebook runs **inside Docker**, so it can't see `localhost:1234` — I wired the credentials to **`host.docker.internal`**. The embedding test returning 768 dims instantly proves that networking + the whole wiring is correct.\n\n## Honest status on chat\nThe **chat** test (gemma-4-12b-qat) and **tools** test (Qwen3-8B) timed out — not a config error (embedding works through the *same* LM Studio credential). On this machine, with Docker + Neo4j + ollama + LM Studio + Lemonade all running, the 12B model is slow to JIT-load. A direct call to it also didn't return in 120s. **Fix:** pre-load `gemma-4-12b-qat` in the LM Studio UI so it stays resident (or, if you want snappier open-notebook chat, edit the config to point `default_chat_model` at a smaller Lemonade model and re-run).\n\n## You're unblocked for the 2b RAG test\nThe embedding model — the part that actually matters for ingesting/storing sources — works. And for **Phase 2b specifically**, open-notebook's chat model isn't even on the path: the bridge exports source *text* to Benny, and **Benny** runs the RAG chat with its own model. So:\n1. Open http://localhost:8502 → create a notebook → add a source (it'll embed via the working model).\n2. Run the bridge: `node prime-silo/scripts/openstudio-notebook-bridge.mjs --data-in \"<BENNY_HOME>/workspaces/default/data_in\"`.\n\nEverything's documented in [OPEN-STUDIO.md](prime-silo/OPEN-STUDIO.md) under \"open-notebook model configuration.\" Want me to point the chat default at a faster Lemonade model so open-notebook's own chat is responsive too?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3354,"cache_read_input_tokens":495497,"output_tokens":1155,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3354,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1155,"cache_read_input_tokens":495497,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3354,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3354},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcD9YapXeWyniqQwSevSF","type":"assistant","uuid":"13da1009-d8de-473c-8189-782f9ba05281","timestamp":"2026-06-19T19:11:31.024Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\scripts","sessionId":"c9e03e56-5425-4e3d-8d0c-40d1a1b8d58d","version":"2.1.181","gi